      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.51,
      "end_seconds": 41.59,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "it's, It's been six months now i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't and I've been putting on weight as well"
    },
